AACS support for the Enigma2 Blu-ray Player is disabled by default.

To test an AACS-protected disc, place a legally obtained key database at one
of these locations. The hard disk location is checked first:

    /media/hdd/aacs/KEYDB.cfg

    /etc/xdg/aacs/KEYDB.cfg

Then open the Blu-ray Player, press the blue button for Settings, and enable
AACS support. openATV does not provide or download decryption keys.

Information about a third-party key database is available at:

    https://fvonline-db.bplaced.net/

Only use keys where this is permitted for you and your disc.
